<title>JAPAN: Shofu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shofu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.35		vs	    6.09</p>
<p> Operating	  634    million    vs	  373    million</p>
<p> Current	    648    million    vs	  425    million</p>
<p> Net		  297    million    vs	  110    million</p>
<p> EPS		   30.44 yen	  vs	   11.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shofu Co Ltd is a manufacturer of dental materials.</p>
</text>
